    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious four-bedroom Residence on C. 0.65 of an arce\r\nThis spacious four-bedroom detached residence extends to C. 178 sq. mt. spread over two floors, enjoys a central location between the towns of Gorey, Wexford and Enniscorthy. Ideally situated within easy reach of the stunning Wexford coastline and its many beautiful beaches and access to the motorway. The property offers an excellent balance of countryside living and convenient access to local amenities. This home would make an ideal choice for families seeking comfort, space and a well-connected location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch: 1.38 x 1.5 semi solid wooden floor. \r\n \r\nHall: 2.8 x 4.88 semi solid wooden floor, staircase to first floor, under stairs storage.\r\n \r\nLiving room: 3.97 x 4.68 semi solid wooden floor, bay windows, solid fuel stove, coving.\r\n\r\nKitchen: 4.32 x 3.6 fitted kitchen eye and waist level, tiled splash back, tiled floor, double oven & hob dishwasher, fridge freezer, archway to dining room.  \r\n\r\nDining room: 3.78 x 3.96 semi solid wooden floor, arch to kitchen, coving.\r\n \r\nSunroom: 4.17 x 4 tiled floor, patio door, double doors to dining room.\r\n\r\nUtility: 2.7 x 2.3 tiled floor, fitted unit, part tiled walls, back door.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (downstairs): 3.91 x 3.7 semi solid wooden floor, fitted wardrobes, fitted units, bay windows. \r\n\r\nW.C: 2.30 x 2 tiled floor, tiled walls, W.C.WHB, Free standing shower.\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom: 4.53 x 4 solid wooden floor, walk in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEnsuite: 3 x 1.9 tiled floor, tiled walls, W.C.WHB, free standing electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 4.2 x 3.88 solid timber floor, fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 3.88 x 3.46 solid timber floor, fitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 3.6 x 2.79 tiled floor, partial tiled walls, bath, W.C.WHB, free standing shower.\r\n\r\nGarage/Storage area\r\n\r\nGarage/Office: 6.7 x 4.7 \r\n\r\nUtility area 1: 2.5 x 2 \r\n\r\nUtility area 2: 2.4 x 2.3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tSpacious C. 178 sq. m four-bedroom residence with detached garage of C.50 Sq.mt \r\n•\tC. 0.65 Arce site fully landscaped with mature boundaries \r\n•\tAmple parking surrounding the property\r\n•\tLarge patio to the rear of the property\r\n•\tGood size lawns \r\n•\tNice standard of finish throughout \r\n•\tConveniently located to the towns of Gorey, Wexford and Enniscorthy \r\n•\tConveniently located to the Wexford coastline and easy reach of the motorway.\r\n•\tHigh-speed broadband available with speeds of up to 500 Mb"
      },
